      "q": "How much federal contract money goes to Arizona?",
      "a": "Arizona received $22.6B in federal contract obligations in FY2026 to date. That total reflects 14,419 awards at an average award size of $1.6M, and obligations fell 3.0% year over year. The FY26 total follows FY25 at $23.3B and earlier fiscal years that ranged from $15.3B to $19.8B."
    },
